timestamp=2026-11-14T13:56:02.429Z level=INFO run=aadc5341 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c \"\nfrom math import gcd\nres=[]\nfor s in range(50,4000):\n  for k in range(1,3000):\n    p=(20+k*s)%8000\n    bad=False\n    for q in (p,(p+4)%8000):\n      if q>=8000-5 or q<=10: bad=True\n    if bad: break\n  K=k-1\n  if K<300: continue\n  for N in (250,400,600):\n    if N>K: continue\n    pos=sorted((20+i*s)%8000 for i in range(N))\n    mg=max(b-a for a,b in zip(pos,pos[1:]+[pos[0]+8000]))\n    res.append((N,mg,s,K))\nfor N in (250,400,600):\n  r=sorted([x for x in res if x[0]==N],key=lambda x:x[1])[:5]; print(r)\n\"" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
